msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"I can't believe this, Kiryu-san! He double-crossed me! That piece of "
"garbage pillaged the office. He took everything...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Calm down for a minute. What's this about garbage now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"How can I calm down when my whole company just disappeared!? All my hard "
"work, all my savings... Even the staff are gone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "So who's responsible for all this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "It has to be Yokoi, of course! Urgh, that arrogant, conniving... asshole!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"He even set up a phony business on Showa Street called Yokoi Office. At "
"least come up with a good name, you giant turd!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"You know what⑬I'm done getting screwed over by this guy! I'm gonna go smash "
"his face in!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Hey, hang on!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"(So her boyfriend sets up shop on Showa Street, using her money and "
"resources to do it... Guess I need to go set things straight.)"
msgstr ""

